      "bestArea": "Unguarded/movement shooting improved dramatically — catch-and-shoot went from 34.0% FG (Good) as a freshman-ish role player to 42.5% FG (Excellent, 92nd percentile) with career 37.9% FG (1.138 PPS) on real volume. Rim finishing is also a real strength (career 60.3% FG, 141 attempts).",
